Chess Rules 不需要重复测试 chesslib 所有内部规则。

但必须测试你的包装层：

```text
e2 → e4

illegal move rejected

cannot move opponent piece

wrong player turn

castling

en passant

promotion

check

checkmate

stalemate

draw offer

threefold claim

50 move claim

clock timeout
```

以及：

```text
UI 点击
→ square
→ Move
```

坐标映射。

